ROADMAP.md:42:- [ ] **Revision-aware persistence** — Replace blind whole-document last-writer-wins updates with an explicit revision/ETag contract and conflict response.
ROADMAP.md:53:- [ ] **Strict report contract** — Validate `elistly.device-intake.v1`, enforce size/depth/type limits, and reject unsupported schemas before creating a preview.
ROADMAP.md:54:- [ ] **Side-effect-free preview** — Show exact create/update changes without mutating schema, dropdowns, entities, or persisted data.
ROADMAP.md:72:- [ ] **Versioned backup envelope** — One schema-versioned full export that includes workspaces, settings, categories, types, entities, associations, and restorable metadata.
ROADMAP.md:76:- [ ] **CSV import** — Map columns to one entity type, preview validation, then bulk-create through the authoritative mutation path.
ROADMAP.md:83:- [ ] **Bulk actions** — Select multiple entities for export, category movement, or confirmed deletion.
ROADMAP.md:99:- [ ] **Normalized ownership/revision design** — Define list/category/item ownership, permissions, revisions, and migration from existing payloads.
ROADMAP.md:102:- [ ] **Activity log** — Record who changed what, when, and from which prior revision.
